# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public scripts repo: source data and generated corpora are NOT distributed
# here. Obtain each source yourself from its upstream and comply with its own
# licence (see README.md, "Data you have to bring yourself").
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Stage 01: the medical dictionary and every derived scoring pass.
01_dictionnary/original_dictionnary*.jsonl
*/generated_dataset.jsonl.bak

# Stage 03: PARHAF (HealthDataHub, CC BY 4.0 + Etalab 2.0), upstream and derived.
03_PARHAF/*.parquet
03_PARHAF/01_parhaf_documents.jsonl
03_PARHAF/02_parhaf_texts.jsonl

# Stage 04: PARROT (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, non-commercial), upstream and derived.
04_PARROT/PARROT_v1_0*.jsonl
04_PARROT/02_parrot_texts.jsonl

# Stage 06: multi-hundred-MB QC state, and the flagged-clip index it emits.
06_hotfixes/**/full.stt.jsonl
06_hotfixes/**/full.stt.jsonl.*
06_hotfixes/**/full.improved.jsonl
06_hotfixes/suspicious_audio/

# Stage 07: the raw French Wikipedia scrape and its intermediates carry verbatim
# CC BY-SA article prose. Only the hand-filtered 511-row CSV ships.
